# Tracked packages for the gentoo-gnome overlay.
# Each entry is an atom with an optional slot specifying the FTP slot to track.
#
# Slot formats:
#   :51         GNOME app major version (integer)
#   :4.24       library major.minor — even minor = stable series, odd = dev/unstable
#   :2.90       same; 2.90 is stable, 2.89 would be dev
#   (no slot)   latest available on FTP with no slot filtering
#
# When a library moves from an odd slot (dev) to the next even slot (stable),
# update the slot here so gup sync picks up the new series.

